00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:54.940
Analog
You mean Kanji Tatsumi?

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:58.270
We just saw him on the news!

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:00.610
Man, we missed the mark.

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:03.280
So much for the victims only being women.

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:06.010
I doubt there's any connection
between him and Ms. Yamano.

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:11.050
Kanji, eh? He wasn't like this when he was little.

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:15.420
Yukiko, you actually know that creep?

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:19.630
Yes. His family runs a textile shop.

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:22.560
The inn has sold their wares for ages.

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:25.630
But I haven't spoken with Kanji
for a long time now.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.300
That simplifies things!

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:31.300
Let's go check out that textile shop.

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:37.440
Good idea. If the people on Midnight Channel
are being thrown into the TV...

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:38.680
Yeah.

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:39.080
Tatsu m i Textiles
Yeah.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:39.750
Tatsumi Textiles
Kanji Tatsumi will be next.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.340
Kanji Tatsumi will be next.

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:45.220
Excuse me!

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:47.990
Oh! Come on in, Yuki.

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:49.930
I'll be taking my leave.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:53.600
Oh, I'm sorry I was not of much help.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:56.290
Not at all. You gave me
something to think about.

00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:57.500
I'll see you later.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.130
Goodbye.

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:05.970
What gives?

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:08.140
Yuki, you're as beautiful as ever.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.730
You're too kind!

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.240
Um, where's Kanji?

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:13.850
He's still not back yet.

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:15.820
Is that right?

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:19.620
I've seen this scarf somewhere before...

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.320
Which one?

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:23.990
Oh, I know!

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:26.460
It was there, in the TV.

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:28.690
It was in the room with the faceless posters.

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:31.020
So it was Ms. Yamano's?

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:34.670
Were you friends with Ms. Yamano?

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:37.110
I wouldn't say friends...

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:41.010
Ms. Yamano had that scarf
custom made-to-order.

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:43.750
Excuse me! Package delivery.

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:45.240
Coming!

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:48.750
I'm sorry, but I have to step out for a moment.

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:52.080
It's okay. We were just leaving anyway.

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:54.690
Huh?

00:14:56.860 --> 00:14:58.190
It's Kanji Tatsumi.

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:00.760
Oh, shit! Hide!

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:03.760
Y... you want to talk?

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:06.800
Yes, I'm quite intrigued with you.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:09.770
I guess that's cool.

00:15:09.770 --> 00:15:13.070
I'll be waiting for you after school tomorrow.

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:16.940
H... he's "intrigued"?

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:20.810
He's a dude intrigued with me, a fellow dude?

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:27.420
What're you looking at?!

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:28.650
Split!

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:32.560
Tch, what's their problem?

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:36.360
THE TREE IS A
NATURAL MEMORIAL
SACRED TREE

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:38.030
THE TREE IS A
NATURAL MEMORIAL
SACRED TREE
That scared me.

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:40.440
THE TREE IS A
NATURAL MEMORIAL
SACRED TREE
I couldn't hear a word they said.

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:45.970
THE TREE IS A
NATURAL MEMORIAL
SACRED TREE
I know! Let's keep a watch over
Kanji Tatsumi and the textile shop.

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:50.510
THE TREE IS A
NATURAL MEMORIAL
SACRED TREE
Yeah. If the killer really is after Kanji Tatsumi,

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:55.650
THE TREE IS A
NATURAL MEMORIAL
SACRED TREE
he'll either approach him directly
or drop by his house.

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:56.080
THE TREE IS A
NATURAL MEMORIAL
SACRED TREE
So it's settled!

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.110
So it's settled!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:01.310
That said, Amagi, could you
give me your cell number?

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:03.860
So that's what you were after!

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:07.490
'Course not! But I'll be needing it for stuff.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:13.270
Actually, could you stop calling
and telling me dirty jokes at night?

00:16:13.270 --> 00:16:14.840
You are such a perv.

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.770
Don't interrupt!

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:18.710
C'mon, Amagi! You don't mind, right?

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:22.540
I just remembered I have to get some tofu.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:23.940
That's it?

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.990
What's gotten into me?

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:42.120
Yasogami
High
School

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:44.630
He's here!

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:49.700
Sorry, did I make you wait?

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:53.370
No, I... I just got here.

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:59.350
Something about them seems weird.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.150
Weird? How so?

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:05.590
Dunno. Maybe it's just my imagination.

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:08.990
Whatever. Satonaka and I'll trail Tatsumi.

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:10.030
What?!

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:13.430
Narukami and Amagi,
keep an eye on Tatsumi Textiles.

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:14.400
You got it.

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:15.230
Let's go!

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:15.790
Y... yeah!

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:17.520
Tatsu m i Textiles

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:22.670
Do you think the killer will come?

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:23.930
Are you scared?

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:30.800
A little, but my desire to do
something outweighs it.

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:34.810
I'm sure there's something I can do to help.

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:37.380
Don't stress out.

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:40.890
Is... is it that obvious?

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:43.950
I guess I really am nervous...

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:46.230
You should ease up.

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:48.830
There's still a chance the killer won't show up.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:53.200
That's not it. I'm nervous over something else.

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:59.630
I've never been alone with a boy
my own age before or anything.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:04.880
With that personality of hers,
Chie has a lot of guy friends.

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:05.550
Tatsuhime
Shrine

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:09.080
Tatsuhime
Shrine
But she seems to be enjoying
you and Hanamura a lot.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:09.150
Tatsuhime
Shrine

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.910
Tatsuhime
Shrine
Is that right?

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:14.190
I'm having fun, too.

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:24.130
I... I'm sorry. I made things even more awkward.

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:25.360
Nah.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:28.200
I wonder how Chie's managing.

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:29.690
I'll give her a ring.

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:36.210
No good. The line's busy...

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:38.840
And I don't know Hanamura's number.

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:40.420
I need it, too.

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:42.180
Hanamura's number?

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:43.790
Yours.

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:45.010
Eh?

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:49.890
Well, I might need it for the investigation.

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:55.260
Yeah, you're right. We need to
keep in contact with each other.

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:06.500
Hey...

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:10.840
May I cut to the chase
and ask you a few questions?

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:16.080
Satonaka, Satonaka, do you copy? Over.

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:17.450
I hear ya.

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:21.390
The target is conversing
200m in front of me. Over.

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:23.690
Say...

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:26.660
Why're we positioned like this again?

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:31.000
We'd both get busted if he
found us together. Over, jeez.

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:33.600
You put "over" in the wrong spot.

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:38.160
So I was thinking we should
split up a little. Over.

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:40.310
Then this is pointless.

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:42.780
It's 100% guaranteed he'd get us both.

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:45.810
That aside, I'm getting the munchies. Over.

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:49.270
Like I care! Why don't you just order delivery?

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:51.820
A delivery? But we're outside.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.290
Didn't you know?

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:58.430
Aiya's known to deliver
anywhere and everywhere.

00:19:58.430 --> 00:19:59.420
For real?!

00:19:59.730 --> 00:20:01.350
In that case...

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:07.370
Excuse me, but I'd like
a delivery for two nikudon.

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:08.800
I don't want anything!

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:10.370
Who said it's for you?

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:12.170
They're both for me!

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:14.110
Oh, you don't say!

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:15.940
I'm at...

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.310
Hey, you!

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:20.340
Whadda ya think yer doin'?

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:27.420
W... we're just a loving couple passin' by!

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:28.490
In your dreams!

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:30.160
Don't argue with me, stupid!

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:32.320
But I don't like what I don't like!

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:36.030
Huh? Didn't I see you yesterday?

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:39.770
We aren't trying to get in your way.

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:41.860
And we don't think it's queer or anything!

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:44.270
Q... queer?

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:47.640
Satonaka, you moron! Keep your mouth shut.

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:48.770
Run for it.

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:50.580
Hey, Hanamura!

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:52.240
You're too quick to run!

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:54.180
Hey! Stop right there!

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:58.650
It's not like that! I swear it isn't!

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:04.020
Sorry, but we brought trouble!

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:05.890
Yukiko, I'm sorry!

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:07.460
He's chasing them?

00:21:07.460 --> 00:21:08.290
Let's run.

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:09.890
Wait, dammit!

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:11.930
I said to wait up!

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.460
You're dead! You're so friggin' dead!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:17.200
Damn it! He's gonna get all of us at this rate.

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:19.400
Time to become our decoy, Satonaka!

00:21:19.470 --> 00:21:20.340
Why me?!

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:24.670
You know the line,
"I'll handle him; you keep going!"

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:26.400
This is your chance to say it!

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:27.740
You have a point.

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:30.150
Chie, don't let him trick you!

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:33.580
I said to stop running from me!

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:35.280
The hell?!

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:37.230
Thanks for the order.

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:38.330
WHAT?!

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:40.190
Here's your delivery.

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:44.190
How'd you find us when
we've been on the move?

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:46.260
The total is 1,600 yen.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:47.500
Don't blow me off!

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:49.270
Sorry, do you have change?

00:21:49.270 --> 00:21:50.240
And you're paying?!

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:52.110
Chie, here's a hundred yen.

00:21:52.110 --> 00:21:53.470
Save it for later!

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:55.480
Just leave the bowls.

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:57.270
Where?!

00:22:01.650 --> 00:22:03.120
We managed to lose him.

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:04.320
Yeah...

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:05.250
Chie...

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:06.320
Is it good?

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:10.490
Ah, it's so nice and warm!

00:22:10.730 --> 00:22:14.860
Man, this sucks! We can't keep this up!

00:22:14.860 --> 00:22:16.330
Let's disband already!

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:18.220
But what about Kanji?

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:20.940
He'll be fine on his own.

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:23.270
He won't get kidnapped without a fight.

00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:25.900
Let's keep an eye on him a bit longer.

00:22:26.210 --> 00:22:28.900
Well, we're done for today.

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:32.470
Where should I leave the bowls?

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:33.650
no time to waste

00:22:33.650 --> 00:22:34.220
but make you pace

00:22:34.220 --> 00:22:36.120
it's OK to remove copy and paste

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:37.120
I'm doing my way

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:37.990
you do it your way

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:39.650
don't just follow your left find the right way

00:22:39.650 --> 00:22:40.390
stereotypes

00:22:40.390 --> 00:22:41.290
too many hypes

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:43.090
but I'm the epitome of new types

00:22:43.090 --> 00:22:44.790
having the fear is power to my soul

00:22:44.790 --> 00:22:45.790
cuz I overcome them

00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:46.490
that's how I roll

00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:48.100
expose your thoughts

00:22:48.100 --> 00:22:51.630
don't be afraid of making mistakes

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:54.190
rules prevailing in

00:22:54.500 --> 00:22:58.870
that may be your greatest rival

00:23:00.340 --> 00:23:03.850
believe in faith and your heart

00:23:03.850 --> 00:23:06.980
your true soul stop being

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:09.550
in the shades come on

00:23:09.550 --> 00:23:12.950
out in the open sun

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:18.990
Beauty of the child of destiny

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:22.430
delightful days

00:23:22.430 --> 00:23:27.500
are with rich density of love

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:29.090
thorny path

00:23:29.900 --> 00:23:34.360
there's no easy way for real bliss

00:23:34.710 --> 00:23:37.550
so I keep on fighting for

00:23:37.550 --> 00:23:42.350
beauty of destiny

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:53.130
Analog

00:23:53.130 --> 00:23:55.930
Analog
Good evening, darlings.

00:23:55.930 --> 00:23:56.000
Analog

00:23:56.000 --> 00:24:00.470
Analog
Today we are going to surpass
the gender barrier

00:24:00.470 --> 00:24:00.540
Analog

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:03.910
Analog
and visit a facility frequented
by those who seek sublime love.

00:24:03.910 --> 00:24:04.170
Analog

00:24:04.170 --> 00:24:07.480
Analog
I will be your reporter.

00:24:07.480 --> 00:24:08.440
Analog

00:24:08.440 --> 00:24:11.710
Analog
I'm Kanji Tatsumi, darlings!

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:15.780
No way...

00:24:18.550 --> 00:24:21.060
H... hold it! I don't wanna go in there!

00:24:21.060 --> 00:24:22.390
That pisses me off!

00:24:22.390 --> 00:24:23.560
Calm down, Yukiko!

00:24:23.560 --> 00:24:26.330
If you don't stop this crap...

00:24:26.330 --> 00:24:28.690
It's our last hustle time!

00:24:28.860 --> 00:24:30.330
Ch... change!
